      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I found Joel a great help. I had already been to a few suppliers and did a bit of shopping around. I knew what product I wanted and Joel didn't try to sell me other products that he may or may not represent. He was straight up and factual.He was able to install when I asked him to and turned up on time and on the correct day. Unlike most builders/trades.He and his team were polite, punctual and didn't leave a mess on site. I found him great to talk to about the installation and his professionalism was outstanding. We had a few snags with setting up the inverter but Joel liaised with the manufacturer and all was sorted. I didn't have to do a thing.I can not comment on after sales service yet as my install is only a few weeks old at the time of writing this but judging by his personality and demeanor I believe he will stay true to his word and come out and repair any issue that may occur under warranty.I would highly recommend Solwave Energy to all looking at getting Solar.",
