      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I was  referred to Solwave Energy by Solar Quotes.  I liked the fact that Joel was not a “solar salesman” but owns the company, has installed  solar himself and knows what he is talking about. Joel offered to come out to my home, which other companies would not do.During the consultation Joel discussed what my requirements were, the panel placement, type of inverter and explained the whole process in detail.  He did not hesitate to climb on the roof to check measurements.The installation was quick and efficient,  I was kept informed during the whole process by Joel and his crew.  Joel organized all paperwork, grid connection and approvals etc.  I also appreciated the after installation follow ups by Joel.I felt very comfortable with my decision to accept the quote to and have Solwave install my solar system. I found Joel to be down to earth, likeable and very informative.I cannot thank Joel and his crew enough for making my solar experience stress free from start to finish.I would not hesitate to recommend Solwave Energy to anyone  looking to have solar installed.",
